# A republish keeps the backup's ranking time, as 10.2.0 did with its first
# capture time, so a pass right after a capture of an unchanged tree prunes the
# backup the capture has just returned. KeepPolicyHonoured judges the policy by
# when a backup was really last captured.
MODULE: BackupRetention
ROW: KeepPolicyHonoured
FILE: src/lattice.backup/BackupManifestRegistration.cs
DETECTORS: BackupRepublishHoldTests.A_republish_refreshes_the_ranking_so_retention_keeps_the_backup_a_capture_just_returned, BackupManifestRegistrationTests.Reconcile_records_the_latest_capture_for_retention_to_rank_by
SUMMARY: a republished backup keeps its stale ranking time

--- FIND
            LastCapturedAtUtc = latest > existing.CreatedAtUtc ? latest : null,
--- REPLACE
            LastCapturedAtUtc = existing.LastCapturedAtUtc,
--- END
